DESCRIPTION >
    Versioned conversion journeys. A row becomes visible only when its matching
    conversion commit exists, so partial Worker retries never reach reports.

SCHEMA >
    `tenant_id` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.tenant_id`,
    `batch_version` UInt64 `json:$.batch_version`,
    `batch_id` String `json:$.batch_id`,
    `committed_at` DateTime64(6) `json:$.committed_at`,
